<section class="services"><div class="wrap">
 <h2 class="sec-h rv">One sector. Complete commercial coverage.</h2>
 <p class="sec-lead rv d2">From individual dwellings to institutional portfolios, we advise across the full lifecycle of an SDA asset, and we do nothing else.</p>
 <div class="svcs">
  <div class="svc a1 rv"><div class="no">01</div><h3>Property &amp; Portfolio Sales</h3><p>Divestment of completed SDA assets, from single dwellings to large institutional portfolios, backed by real transaction evidence.</p><a href="/sda-property-and-portfolio-sales/">Learn more →</a></div>
  <div class="svc a2 rv d2"><div class="no">02</div><h3>Vendor Due Diligence</h3><p>Commercial due diligence and market intelligence that surface the factors driving occupancy, income sustainability and capital value.</p><a href="/sda-strategic-divestment-advisory/">Learn more →</a></div>
  <div class="svc a3 rv d3"><div class="no">03</div><h3>Strategic Advisory</h3><p>Buyer representation, M&amp;A advisory, and strategic review of residential holdings for SIL providers repositioning for the future.</p><a href="/buying-and-selling-sda-property-portfolios/">Learn more →</a></div>
 </div>
</div></section>
<style>
.services{padding:104px 0;background:radial-gradient(1000px 520px at 80% 15%,rgba(4,118,217,.10),transparent 60%),var(--navy)}
.svcs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:52px}
.svc{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(185,203,224,.16);border-radius:8px;padding:38px 30px;transition:transform .25s,background .25s,border-color .25s}
.svc::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:3px;width:100%;background:var(--acc);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s}
.svc:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--acc);background:var(--acc-bg)}
.svc:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.svc.a1{--acc:var(--blue);--acc-bg:rgba(4,118,217,.09)}
.svc.a2{--acc:var(--teal);--acc-bg:rgba(47,160,168,.10)}
.svc.a3{--acc:var(--amber);--acc-bg:rgba(201,122,10,.10)}
.svc .no{font-family:var(--cond);font-weight:600;font-size:22px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.05em;transition:color .25s}
.svc:hover .no,.svc:hover h3{color:var(--acc)}
.svc:hover a{color:var(--acc)}
.svc h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:24px;color:#fff;margin:14px 0 12px;line-height:1.15}
.svc p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--pale);margin:0 0 20px}
.svc a{font-family:var(--geo);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none}
@media(max-width:860px){.svcs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.svcs{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
